---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const structuredData = {
	"@context": "https://schema.org",
	"@type": "AboutPage",
	name: "About Lorem Ipsum Generator",
	url: new URL("/about", Astro.site).toString(),
	description:
		"Learn about Lorem Ipsum Generator, a free, no-signup placeholder text tool for generating lorem ipsum by paragraph, sentence, word, or exact character count.",
	mainEntity: {
		"@type": "WebApplication",
		name: "Lorem Ipsum Generator",
		url: Astro.site?.toString(),
		applicationCategory: "DesignApplication",
		operatingSystem: "Any",
		offers: {
			"@type": "Offer",
			price: "0",
			priceCurrency: "USD",
		},
	},
};
---

<PageLayout
	title="About Lorem Ipsum Generator — Free Placeholder Text Tool"
	description="Lorem Ipsum Generator is a free, no-signup lorem ipsum generator for designers and developers. Generate placeholder text by paragraph, sentence, word, or exact character count, in classic Latin or five themed word banks."
	eyebrow="About us"
	heading="About Lorem Ipsum Generator"
	structuredData={structuredData}
>
	<p>
		Lorem Ipsum Generator is a free lorem ipsum generator built for real
		design and development workflows — not just one fixed block of Latin
		copied from an old bookmark. Every visit gives you a fresh online lorem
		ipsum generator session: pick a vocabulary, set an exact amount, and
		export the placeholder text in the format your project needs, all
		without an account or a page reload.
	</p>

	<h2>Why we built another lorem ipsum generator</h2>
	<p>
		Most lorem ipsum generators online do one thing: dump a fixed number of
		paragraphs of Latin. That covers the easy case, but it breaks down the
		moment you need a lorem ipsum generator by character count — for example,
		testing a 155-character meta description, a tweet-length caption, or a
		fixed-width form field where "close enough" isn't good enough. We built
		this tool to handle paragraph, sentence, word, and exact
		character-count modes in one place, so you're not switching tools
		depending on what you're testing.
	</p>

	<h2>What makes this generator different</h2>
	<p>
		Generate text by paragraph, sentence, or word, or dial in an exact
		character count — set the unit to <strong>Characters</strong>, enter a
		number like 500, and the <a href="/#generator">lorem ipsum generator</a>{" "}
		above returns exactly that many characters, not an approximation.
		Choose classic Latin or one of five <a href="/#themes">themed word banks</a>{" "}
		— Corporate, Tech/Startup, Foodie, Cat, and a funny lorem ipsum option
		built from absurd filler words — when you want placeholder copy that
		still feels on-brand instead of a 2,000-year-old Latin treatise. Then
		copy the result instantly as plain text, HTML wrapped in
		&lt;p&gt; tags, or Markdown.
	</p>

	<h2>How it works</h2>
	<p>
		Everything runs client-side, directly in your browser. Generated text,
		the options you choose, and anything you paste are never sent to a
		server or stored anywhere — there's no database, no account, and no
		usage limit. That also means the generator works instantly: change the
		theme, amount, or unit and the output regenerates live, with word and
		character counters updating as you go. See our{" "}
		<a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> for the full details on
		what limited technical data we do collect.
	</p>

	<h2>Who it's for</h2>
	<p>
		Designers mocking up layouts who need realistic-looking text without
		distracting a client with real copy. Developers seeding test data or
		checking how a UI handles a specific character count. Writers and
		content strategists blocking out a draft's structure before real copy
		is ready. If you've ever searched for a lorem ipsum generator
		online, a lorem ipsum generator by character count, or a funny lorem
		ipsum generator for a lighter design review, this tool is built for
		that exact use case.
	</p>

	<h2>Get in touch</h2>
	<p>
		Questions, feedback, or a themed word bank you'd like to see added?
		Visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> — we read every message.
		You can also jump straight to the <a href="/#generator">generator</a>{" "}
		or check the <a href="/#faq">FAQ</a> for answers to common questions
		about paragraph, word, and character-count modes.
	</p>
</PageLayout>
